      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Holter-monitoring offers a possibility to detect asymptomatic coronary-heart-disease-patients, suffering from peripher-arteric-occlusion stadium II-IV, and introduce them to effective medication. It became evident, that about 30% of all patients with unknown coronary-heart-disease, even as patients who were therapied against coronary-heart-disease, have had silent myocard ischemia."},
